    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u24c](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u24c) Magnitude 6.0 earthquake at 20.842 depth occurred on Oct 13 2026 40km E of Buka. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -5.4832 longitude 152.1364. It impacted 6190 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
